# Project Context
This project is a local self-correcting code execution agent.
It uses Ollama (local LLM), LangChain (orchestration), and a subprocess runner to run Python code and fix any errors.

# Tech Stack
- LangChain / LangChain-Ollama
- Python 3.10+
- Hugging Face (transformers, datasets)

# Code Style Guidelines
- Keep helper functions modular.
- Always use standard try/except blocks with subprocesses to handle errors gracefully.
- Minimize external dependencies outside of standard library and LangChain.